    "body": "Since you're in the `else` block of `if(!results)`, this should suffice :\r\n```suggestion\r\n            !results.disjunctiveFacets?.length &&\r\n            !results.facets?.length &&\r\n            !results.hierarchicalFacets?.length;\r\n```",
